* Perform a CMS370 CREXX build of the file packer
&ERROR &EXIT &RETCODE

&DEBUG = &1
&SRCDISK = &2
&BINDISK = &3
&PARMFN = CREXX&DEBUG

* cpacker/CMakeLists.txt
EXEC CRXGCC RXCPACK C &SRCDISK ( CMS PARM &PARMFN CSECT

TXTLIB GEN RXCPACK RXCPACK

GLOBAL TXTLIB RXCPACK CMSUTIL PLATFORM GCCLIB
LOAD RXCPACK@ CMSUTIL@ PLATFOR@ ( CLEAR NOAUTO RESET @@MAIN
GENMOD RXCPACK&DEBUG (FROM RXCPACK@
&TYPE RXCPACK&DEBUG -V
RXCPACK&DEBUG -V
COPY RXCPACK&DEBUG MODULE A = = &BINDISK ( OLDDATE REPLACE
COPY LOAD MAP A RXCPACK&DEBUG = &BINDISK ( OLDDATE REPLACE
ERASE * TEXT A
ERASE RXCPACK&DEBUG MODULE A
ERASE LOAD MAP A

&EXIT 0
